  "settings.privacy.description": {
    "en": "Restricts common document-level canvas, WebGL, audio and font fingerprint reads. Worker and cross-frame fingerprint resistance is not guaranteed. Some sites may not work. Claude, Anthropic, Gemini, Google sign-in and challenges.cloudflare.com use compatibility exceptions for verification. Network privacy protections remain active. It does not hide your account, cookies, IP address or every possible fingerprint.",
    "zh": "限制常见网页 Canvas、WebGL、音频和字体指纹读取；不保证覆盖 Worker 和跨框架读取，部分网站可能受限。Claude、Anthropic、Gemini、Google 登录和官方 Cloudflare 验证域名使用兼容例外，网络防护仍开启。账号、Cookie、出口 IP 和其他指纹仍可能识别用户。",
    "comment": "Browser interface: settings.privacy.description"
  },
  "settings.privacy.dnsDescription": {
    "en": "When Chromium resolves a hostname it uses encrypted DNS. Website names are resolved through DoH before proxy tunneling. Proxy-side traffic inspection or DNS rules may still affect observed results. Cloudflare receives DNS queries. If DoH is unreachable, name resolution may fail.",
    "zh": "浏览器先通过加密 DoH 解析域名，再建立代理隧道。代理端流量嗅探或规则仍可能影响结果。Cloudflare 会接收 DNS 查询；DoH 不可用时解析会失败。",
    "comment": "Browser interface: settings.privacy.dnsDescription"
  },
